<title>USA: KMG-B Inc gets Nasdaq approval.</title>
<headline>KMG-B Inc gets Nasdaq approval.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>KMG-B Inc said its common stock has been approved for trading on the Nasdaq SmallCap Market on Monday under the symbol &quot;KMGB&quot;.</p>
<p>The company, based in Houston, Texas, manufactures, markets and distributes wood treatment chemicals to industrial customers in a variety of wood-related industries throughout the world.</p>
</text>
